Parameters

channel: TC.RadioChannel
Destination numeric channel, independent of local opens.

replyChannel: TC.RadioChannel
Sender hint only; no automatic reply, route or local channel opening.

payload: TC.Data|nil
Required third position; explicit nil gives an absent event.message.

Returns

No result positions. See the behavior notes for normal-return versus failure semantics.]=],
