TC.Config.Read.SelectorCombinatorParameters.QualityTransfer

Normalized readback for SelectorCombinatorParameters. Operation quality-transfer. Default operation select. select defaults index_constant 0 and select_max true; a signal index replaces the constant. random defaults interval 0 ticks. Input quality-transfer requires quality_destination_signal, while native readback can omit it; defaults select_quality_from_signal false and static normal. Readback keeps only the selected source. stack-size and rocket-capacity have no operation-specific fields. Unknown fields refused. operation_variant: Only fields belonging to the selected operation are allowed.

operation

Exact operation discriminator; only that variant fields are accepted.

"quality-transfer"

quality_destination_signal (optional)

Quality-transfer destination signal; required on input but may be absent in native readback. Unknown fields refused. registered_signal: Installed signal identity required. explicit_signal_type: Input signal type must be explicit.

TC.Config.Read.SignalID

quality_source_signal (optional)

Quality-transfer source when selecting quality from a signal. Unknown fields refused. registered_signal: Installed signal identity required. explicit_signal_type: Input signal type must be explicit.

TC.Config.Read.SignalIDBase

quality_source_static (optional)

Static quality-transfer source; default normal when not using a signal. Unknown fields refused.

TC.Config.Read.BlueprintQualityID

select_quality_from_signal

Choose signal quality rather than static quality; default false.

