TC.RecipeIngredient

Complete native ingredient entry, preserved in recipe order without aggregation.
Optional fields appear only when supplied by the engine for the stated kind;
never invent a quality or conflate exact and interval temperatures.

amount

Finite required quantity, not expected probabilistic yield.

number

fluidbox_index (optional)

Fluid-only native fluidbox index.

integer

fluidbox_multiplier (optional)

Fluid-only native fluidbox multiplier.

integer

ignored_by_stats (optional)

Finite native modifier for either kind.

number

maximum_temperature (optional)

Fluid-only finite upper temperature bound.

number

minimum_temperature (optional)

Fluid-only finite lower temperature bound.

number

name

Exact installed prototype name.

string

quality_change (optional)

Item-only finite native quality modifier.

number

quality_max (optional)

Item-only native quality upper bound when supplied.

string

quality_min (optional)

Item-only native quality lower bound when supplied.

string

spoil_weight (optional)

Item-only finite native spoil modifier.

number

temperature (optional)

Fluid-only exact finite temperature in degrees Celsius.

number

