TC.RecipeProduct

Complete native product entry, not just the queried output. Quantity is exactly
one fixed amount OR the pair amount_min/amount_max according to native readback.
Preserve duplicates, zero modifiers and order. Never multiply amounts by chance,
add productivity, predict quality or synthesize recipes. Optional kind-specific
fields are absent for the other kind and when the engine does not supply them.

affected_by_quality (optional)

Item-only native quality flag when present.

boolean

always_fresh (optional)

Item-only native freshness flag when present.

boolean

amount (optional)

Fixed finite quantity; excludes ranged quantity fields.

number

amount_max (optional)

Finite maximum; present together with amount_min instead of amount.

number

amount_min (optional)

Finite minimum; present together with amount_max instead of amount.

number

extra_count_fraction (optional)

Item-only finite native extra-count fraction.

number

fluidbox_index (optional)

Fluid-only native fluidbox index.

integer

ignored_by_productivity (optional)

Finite native productivity modifier, either kind.

number

ignored_by_stats (optional)

Finite native statistics modifier, either kind.

number

independent_probability

Native independent probability in 0..1.

number

name

Exact installed prototype name.

string

percent_spoiled (optional)

Item-only finite native spoil fraction.

number

probability

Finite marginal independent_probability*(shared_probability.max-shared_probability.min).

number

quality_change (optional)

Item-only finite quality modifier.

number

quality_max (optional)

Item-only native maximum quality name.

string

quality_min (optional)

Item-only native minimum quality name.

string

reset_freshness_on_craft (optional)

Item-only native reset flag when present.

boolean

shared_probability

Native shared interval, not independent per-product chance.

TC.ProbabilityInterval

spoil_weight (optional)

Item-only finite spoil modifier.

number

temperature (optional)

Fluid-only finite temperature in degrees Celsius.

number

type

Product namespace.

